model g8_after
  tally 2
  on 2026-02-15
  start 2026-01-01
  end 2026-03-31
  note "T, issue #41, G8: a projection from a decision's own point keeps the day's decisions after that point (L §5.14.1, E §4.3 step 1): pp projects konto from its point on 5 March; zz, unrelated and after it that day, is refused in its when, which refuses every place from its point, in the main walk and in pp's projection, so pp's amount is refused, as a move's flows read shows; reads before that day are answered."

source fixture "T's fixture for S's kernel tests (invented values)"

unit PLN: currency minor 0.01

place konto: accounts PLN lives 2026-01-01..

place p_pp: accounts PLN lives 2026-01-01..

place z_box: accounts PLN lives 2026-01-01..

place world: outside lives 2026-01-01..

input t_day: date

input t_own: date

input d_end: date

input div_z: num

input small: money PLN

move pp: transfers
  on t_day
  reads konto
  leg cash from world to p_pp amount bal(konto, d_end) from t_own

move zz: transfers
  on t_day
  reads z_box
  when bal(z_box) / div_z > 0
  leg cash from world to z_box amount small

ask q_after: flows(pp, 2026-03-01 .. 2026-03-31), bal(konto, 2026-03-04), bal(p_pp, 2026-03-04) law cut

version facts
  cite fixture
  governs always
  known 2025-12-01
  t_day = 2026-03-05 "pp, then zz, on one day"
  t_own = 2026-03-05 "pp projects from its own point"
  d_end = 2026-03-31
  div_z = 0 "zz's when divides by zero"
  small = 1.00

version openings
  cite fixture
  governs always
  known 2025-12-31
  opening[konto] = 1000 at 2026-01-01 start
  opening[p_pp] = 0 at 2026-01-01 start
  opening[z_box] = 10 at 2026-01-01 start
